section__
  @title "T073 - ACT1 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/01-act1-arc-stark-lannister/frame-073.jpg"

  "At a trampled crossroads, mud, blood, and horse foam mix under torchlight as envoys wait for your signal. Brienne of Tarth pushes for an immediate ruling on a command claim with direct factional consequences, while Theon Greyjoy watches for any hesitation that can be spun as allegiance to the other camp before dawn.

This arc runs on retaliation cycles: each concession is read as weakness by one side and treachery by the other. A public ruling can restrain rumor and bind witnesses, but it narrows your tactical options. A covert ruling can preserve initiative, yet it deepens the expectation that violence, not process, decides outcomes.

You are no longer balancing abstract values. You are deciding which feud hardens tonight and which one can still be postponed."

  choice__
    @target "T074 - ACT1 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Resolve a command claim with direct factional consequences before sworn banners, lock terms to record, and absorb immediate strain to preserve cross-faction legitimacy."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T075 - ACT1 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Settle a command claim with direct factional consequences through deniable pressure and private guarantees, holding tempo now while feeding the next retaliation cycle."
  __choice
__section

